====================================================================================================
one lane = 86.26 tok/s at 69 GHz (band 78.8-92.5)
0.5 TB/s ->   88.2 tok/s -> 2 lanes (51% busy); 16,850-17,422 cells (0.46-0.48 mm^2); fabric 0.13-0.18 W (300 K), 0.27-0.29 W (353 K); 1.5-3.3 mJ/token
